# Four planned mapping-method concerns

Three method-provenance defects are supported, with a qualification to the Diarsenic rationale. Benzene-1,2,4-triol remains a provisional trace observation. No identity change is recommended.

This assessment binds the unchanged `cdff9ef796b6c2ecf112218be61843fc1928f442ff4a7ddd89758ea116be8cb2` plan captures and authentic Git baseline `84241993a278a7a413422ef89a52c0b47dc57831`. It does not treat partially applied B as a final state. W09's captured FINDINGS `8b0f66bc…` and skeptical adjudication `f2cf18e7…` are read-time inputs; their whole final packet was not asserted complete. `planned-bindings.json` contains every exact origin, case and capture, and `DISPOSITIONS.json` contains full hashes and recommended bounds.

